# Public site (apps/web)

- App Router under `src/app/[locale]/`; server components by default, `'use client'` only for interactive leaves.
- Locales: Bulgarian without prefix, English under `/en/`; URLs keep the trailing slash. Use `Link` from `@/i18n/navigation`, not `next/link`, for internal links.
- Data via `src/lib/api/*` (`apiGet`, server-only, ISR). Pages must survive `ApiError` 503 (API down) with a fallback.
- Env only through `src/lib/config/env.ts`; client code reads `NEXT_PUBLIC_*` only.
- Every page: `generateMetadata` via `buildPageMetadata`; new static paths go into `src/app/sitemap.ts`.
- Text via next-intl; add keys to both `src/messages/bg.json` and `src/messages/en.json`.
- Colors from Tailwind tokens in `src/app/globals.css` (`ink`, `stone`, `brass`, `paper`, `line`); no raw hex in components.
- First-party analytics (`src/lib/analytics`) are not consent-gated; GA4 (`src/components/consent`) is. Keep them separate.
- No impure calls (`Date.now()`, storage, random) during render.
- Interactive elements get kebab-case `data-testid`.

```tsx
// Good: server page with metadata and translations
export async function generateMetadata(): Promise<Metadata> {
  const t = await getTranslations('About');
  return buildPageMetadata({ locale: await getLocale(), path: '/about', title: t('title'), description: t('lead') });
}
```
